# Track 4 — on-prem round 1: 2.0 vCPU per domain (10 vCPU total across 5 domains)
#
# | Service             | cpus x count | subtotal |
# |---------------------|--------------|----------|
# | Redis x 2           | 0.15 x 2     | 0.3      |
# | request-handler     | 0.5 x 1      | 0.5      |
# | verifier-selector   | 0.2 x 1      | 0.2      |
# | snark-verifier      | 1.0 x 1      | 1.0      |
# | TOTAL per domain    |              | 2.0      |
